OL,3,GGrampian
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA dry start with sunny spells.
OL,6,FCloud will increase through the
OL,7,Fmorning to bring a few showers, these
OL,8,Fmostly light in nature. Best of the
OL,9,Fsunny spells will be along the east
OL,10,Fcoast.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FA bright evening with
OL,13,Fscattered showers, but these slowly
OL,14,Fdying out. A mostly dry night will
OL,15,Ffollow with variable amounts of cloud.
OL,16,
OL,17,CSunday:FA largely dry day but rather
OL,18,Fcloudy with the best of any brightness
OL,19,Flikely to be in the morning. A little
OL,20,Flight rain at times.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
